  "2026-10-23T23:46:03.618Z","harness:codex","Validation recovery: the linked packed-consumer check reached its600-second limit while package-distribution waited on the full coverage runner exclusive build lease. No packed scenario had executed and no product result is inferred. Preserved the failed test record and updated its timeout metadata to1200 seconds without replacing provenance; rerun after the coverage lease releases. Public strict typecheck already passes and the source type fixture accepts string checkpoint IDs while rejecting booleans."
  "2026-10-24T00:15:22.827Z","harness:codex","Final installed-consumer evidence: the final schema2 packed acceptance exits0 for npm/npx and Bun/bunx across9 installed package workflows; strict installed-SDK compilation accepts checkpoint-ID strings for both bulk action types and rejects a boolean. The prior build-lease timeout remains in history and the successful retry does not erase it. The explicit SDK signature acknowledgement documents correction of the unusable boolean contract; ordinary forward calls omit rollback."
